      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007400680069006E006B00200074006800610074201900730020006100200053006500760069007000650072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "An Arbok?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou’re calling this Pokémon right here beside me\nan Arbok? Nonsense! This is clearly a Seviper!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s with the doubtful tone, kid?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nClearly this Pokémon right here beside me is a\nSeviper! No ifs, ands, or buts about it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still...I’m a reasonable fellow. I can admit when\nI’m wrong about something.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo if you want to insist that this here isn’t a\nSeviper, then you go on and show me a “real” one!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 182
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
