      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006100742019007300200074006800690073002C0020006E006F0077003F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re both Seviper, aren’t they?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI suppose if you squint, maybe they’ve got slightly\ndifferent silhouettes, but that’s nothing.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
